1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:05,880
Using language. Reading, speaking, and writing.

2
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,760
Andy, the Android.

3
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,760
I'm part of an Android football team.

4
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:20,060
About once a year we are allowed to get together to play a game of football.

5
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,660
I’m as big as a human.

6
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,400
In fact, I look like one too.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,620
My computer chips help me to move and think like a human.

8
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:42,180
For example, I have learned to signal to my teammates in computer language to give me the ball

9
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,300
when I am open and have a good shot for a goal.

10
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:48,580
My first football competition was in Nagoya,

11
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,680
Japan several years ago.

12
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:53,100
Last year our team went to Seattle,

13
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,640
Washington in the USA.

14
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:57,800
We won second place.

15
00:00:58,080 --> 00:01:01,220
Personally, I think the team that won first place cheated.

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,340
They had developed a new type of program just before the competition.

17
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:10,460
So we need to encourage our programmer to improve our intelligence too.

18
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:14,300
We are determined to create an even better system.

19
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:17,980
In a way our programmer is like our coach.

20
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:21,900
She programs us with all the possible moves she has seen

21
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:23,600
while watching human games.

22
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:28,620
Then she prepares reliable moves to use if a new situation arises.

23
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:33,820
In this way I can make up new moves using my "artificial intelligence".

24
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:37,500
I would really like to play against a human team,

25
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:40,200
for I have been programmed to act just like them.

26
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:45,480
After all, with the help of my electronic brain which never forgets anything,

27
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:48,400
using my intelligence is what I’m all about!
